{"4809850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Esoteric: Apostate", "steam_appid": 4809850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/a5594b5a660eec676557afef9685ba1b.poster.avif?t=1786130054\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=612 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/a5594b5a660eec676557afef9685ba1b.webm?t=1786130054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/a5594b5a660eec676557afef9685ba1b.mp4?t=1786130054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/32b34a51269ce95bbd3c9a4aeea9b667.avif?t=1786130054\" alt=\"\"width=613 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Embody the enhanced cybernetic might of the future. Scan your surroundings, gather powerful weapons and supplies, and obliterate the techno-zealots of the Church of Hope. Intense third-person stealth-action experience designed for solo play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/a59b93bd40831b474049c2a82c9d99c5.avif?t=1786130054\" alt=\"\"width=616 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/7769ec4a6af68797c35b9e5014634c5d.poster.avif?t=1786130054\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=612 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/7769ec4a6af68797c35b9e5014634c5d.webm?t=1786130054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/7769ec4a6af68797c35b9e5014634c5d.mp4?t=1786130054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight the enemies of the Badlands as Apostate Zai. Prove yourself as the apex predator of the Badlands of Ancient Türkiye. Uncover the mysteries of the Badlands Sultanate, the Nexus Mountains Union, and the Church of Hope, and discover the connection between Aysha and the Acumen beneath the shifting sands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/2ba1ff22a5db61107b5a82425d760137.avif?t=1786130054\" alt=\"\"width=618 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/096896614530f0f430894a86e0da5f47.poster.avif?t=1786130054\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=612 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/096896614530f0f430894a86e0da5f47.webm?t=1786130054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/096896614530f0f430894a86e0da5f47.mp4?t=1786130054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive into a post-apocalyptic war of epic proportions! Experience intense, methodical hybrid third-person action against unique and challenging enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/ea129d0d98428161096fa1756ecaa615.avif?t=1786130054\" alt=\"\"width=616 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into the world of Esoteric: Apostate and face your first enemy faction: the techno-zealots of the Church of Hope. These relentless cybernetic fanatics possess a wide range of deadly specialties and will stop at nothing to hunt you and your allies. The Church you once knew is gone. Now, they worship technology as their god—and you have become an apostate who defied their doctrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/1023df10c7cffd456845ae7bd8378c55.avif?t=1786130054\" alt=\"\"width=758 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/a5594b5a660eec676557afef9685ba1b.poster.avif?t=1786130054\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=612 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/a5594b5a660eec676557afef9685ba1b.webm?t=1786130054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809850/extras/a5594b5a660eec676557afef9685ba1b.mp4?t=1786130054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam